{"script":"sj_002_02","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","scaleY":1,"layer":"chara2","noIn":false,"x":360,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2","noOut":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"transTime":300,"noOut":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]回答之前，我倒想先拿这个问题问问你了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你看，现在营地的功能已经远远超过我的认知了。我反倒开始好奇，在你眼里，这里还有什么改进的余地吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？全自动作物种植装置？全自动物资库管系统？全自动防御弩箭台？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]怎么全是什么全自动啊！而且最后一个也太不对劲了！不要在用来放松身心的地方搞这种仿佛魔物盘踞地一样的设施啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]虽然我也很佩服你的技术和热情啦，而且也很享受你为营地添加的这些便利功能。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]但是……总感觉，你是不是对于自己当前造出来的东西不太满意？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你说怎么会有工匠不欣赏自己的作品……只是比较喜欢做些新的尝试，所以在考虑要不要给营地添一些新的功能？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2l","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]原来如此，工匠的思维方式是这样的啊……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好！决定了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]忙完最近的事，我也来帮忙扩建营地！有了更多的地块，就能让你多制作一些营地设施了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我还真想看看你能做到什么程度呢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"米托拉-营地有没有需要改进的地方？"}